  evidence:
  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH
    source: CultureBotHT
    notes: Imported from CultureBotHT. CAS-RN 314041-10-6 present, but no CHEBI entry
      exists (checked OAK CHEBI sqlite + PubChem CID synonyms). Curator can promote
      to a CHEBI primary if/when CHEBI adds the term.
  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH
    source: anchor_cas_hydrate_records
    notes: 'potassium tellurate hydrate is a hydrate/salt with its own CAS and no
      exact ChEBI term; anchored to the parent CHEBI:30463 ''telluric acid'' by narrowMatch
      per MAPPING_SEMANTICS.md Section 3 step 2. potassium salt hydrate of telluric
      acid (H2O4Te, neutral, 3-STAR). NOT CHEBI:30464 tellurate, which is the (2-)
      anion: a neutral salt is not a kind of a dianion'
  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH
    source: MIM curation (#342)
    notes: 'mapping_quality NARROW_MATCH -> CLOSE_MATCH, predicate skos:narrowMatch
      -> skos:closeMatch. narrowMatch asserts this record is *narrower in meaning*
      than CHEBI:30463 (''telluric acid'') — a subsumption ChEBI itself denies: it
      files hydrates under CHEBI:35505 ''hydrate'', never under the anhydrous compound,
      which is not an ancestor even transitively. A hydrate is a distinct substance
      containing the anhydrous form, not a specialization of it. closeMatch claims
      similarity without subsumption. The ontology_id and the record''s own identifier
      are unchanged.'
  - evidence_type: MANUAL_CURATION
    source: MIM Step7d scientific review (#901)
    notes: 'SourceCAS314041-10-6 names potassiumtelluratehydrate. Primarysupplier
      confirmsK2TeO4·xH2O; distinctCAS preserves this nominalvariablehydrate. See
      the complete identity, mapping, chemistry and synonym assessment in reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/authors/science-c/assessments-v2.json;
      owner selector data/ingredients/mapped/Potassium_Tellurate_Hydrate.yaml. Primary
      source references: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/30463/;
      https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/search?q=potassium%20tellurate%20hydrate&ontology=chebi,ncit&rows=100;
      https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/name/314041-10-6/JSON; https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/US/en/product/aldrich/400580;
      https://github.com/CultureBotAI/CultureBotHT. Captures, exact input hashes and
      scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json. This
      curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed owner
      bytes withdraw inherited support.'
